@TopviewAIhq’s Motion Studio (powered by Seedance 2.5) creates $3,000 AE-level motion graphics for literally ~$3 in minutes.
Just upload your visual reference, prompt it, and let AI do the heavy lifting. Pure magic https://t.co/rWaveAN3D5

